      "value": "ほとんどの製作・加工装置を使わせてあげられなくて、ごめんね。ケビンがそれらを使って、自分自身の小型版を撃ち出す銃を作ろうとして以来、利用を制限しなければならなくなったんだ。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/chatOptions/19",
      "value": "Most hazardous environmental effects can be prevented with either an immunity to that effect, or often through a high enough resistance to specific damage types."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/chatOptions/19",
      "value": "ほとんどの危険な環境影響は、その効果に対する免疫力またはしばしば特定の損傷タイプに対する十分な抵抗によって予防することができる。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/chatOptions/2",
      "value": "Some of the information in those codexes might not seem relevant right now, but even some of our veteran researchers have learned something they didn't know through those books, so keep them in mind!"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/chatOptions/2",
      "value": "これらのコーデックスの情報の中には、現時点では関係ないものもありますが、私たちのベテラン研究者でさえ、これらの本を通して知らなかったことを学びました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/chatOptions/20",
      "value": "Immunities and resistances are seperate - Even if you're immune to a planet's extreme heat, that won't reduce damage from fiery attacks unless you increase your heat resistance."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/chatOptions/20",
      "value": "免疫と抵抗は別々です - たとえあなたが惑星の極端な熱に免疫があるとしても、それはあなたの耐熱性を増加させない限り、炎の攻撃による被害を減らすことはありません。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/chatOptions/21",
      "value": "If things don't seem to be working right, first check to make sure you don't have any incompatible mods installed. If that doesn't work, post your full log file to the bug channel on the Frackin' Universe Discord."
    },
