  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/chatOptions/31",
      "value": "A second reminder: Kevin is a genius, he really is. Super smart. However, I am absolutely certain he is at least a little bit insane. Read the infraction log, and you'll very swiftly understand what I mean."
