      "value": "I mean, the whole lip gloss thing? Yea, it was me that came across it first. I'm always the first one to show up for the day. Trust me - that was awe-inspiringly confusing. I remain uncertain of how he coated the entire base in less than 5 hours. Every surface. Even ones behind objects weighing several tons."
